{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:LiftingAndDescent.QuantumCharacteristicClasses","@type":"LeanModule","name":"LiftingAndDescent.QuantumCharacteristicClasses","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Basic"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumCharacteristicSequence.perpetual","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumCharacteristicSequence.perpetual","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes.lean#L72-L95","doc":"If κ₀ ≠ 0 and corrections are complementary, then κₙ ≠ 0 for all n.\n\nThis is the perpetual obstruction property: the Euler class cannot\nbe cancelled by jet corrections at any level.\n\n**Re-scoped 2026-11-15 (owner decision, PR #7747, bean `qou-lx8f`).**\nThis is a valid conditional: the conclusion holds whenever the\npersistence hypothesis does. It does not apply to the Kummer tower of\nBring's surface, where the obstruction vanishes for `n ∣ χ = -6` and\npersists only for `n ∤ 6`; the \"complementary subgroups\" argument for\npersistence there is withdrawn (item 3 of `thm:qu-to-qou` is now the\ndegree condition). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.instAddCommGroupObstructionSpace_1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.instAddCommGroupObstructionSpace_1","kind":"instance","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes.lean#L68-L70","doc":"Expose the sequence's obstruction-space group structure to resolution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumCharacteristicSequence.corrections_persistent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumCharacteristicSequence.corrections_persistent","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes.lean#L64-L64","doc":"Jet corrections at level n live in a complementary subgroup, so they\ndo not cancel κ₀: the correction at each level is independent of the\nbase obstruction. Encoded: if κₙ ≠ 0 then κ_{n+1} ≠ 0 (persistence). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumCharacteristicSequence.kappa_zero_euler","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumCharacteristicSequence.kappa_zero_euler","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes.lean#L60-L60","doc":"κ₀ equals the Euler class. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumCharacteristicSequence.eulerChar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumCharacteristicSequence.eulerChar","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes.lean#L58-L58","doc":"The Euler characteristic χ(A) = tr(id_A). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumCharacteristicSequence.kappa","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumCharacteristicSequence.kappa","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes.lean#L56-L56","doc":"The obstruction class at each level. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumCharacteristicSequence.addCommGroup","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumCharacteristicSequence.addCommGroup","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes.lean#L54-L54","doc":"The obstruction space is an additive abelian group. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumCharacteristicSequence.ObstructionSpace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumCharacteristicSequence.ObstructionSpace","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes.lean#L52-L52","doc":"The common obstruction space. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumCharacteristicSequence.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumCharacteristicSequence.mk","kind":"ctor","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes.lean#L50-L50","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumCharacteristicSequence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumCharacteristicSequence","kind":"structure","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes.lean#L49-L66","doc":"The full sequence of quantum characteristic classes for a brane tower. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumCharacteristicClass.isUnobstructed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumCharacteristicClass.isUnobstructed","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes.lean#L45-L47","doc":"The extension is unobstructed iff κₙ = 0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.instAddCommGroupObstructionSpace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.instAddCommGroupObstructionSpace","kind":"instance","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes.lean#L41-L43","doc":"Expose the obstruction space's group structure to instance resolution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumCharacteristicClass.kappa","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumCharacteristicClass.kappa","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes.lean#L39-L39","doc":"The obstruction value κₙ ∈ H²(𝒮, ℬ). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumCharacteristicClass.addCommGroup","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumCharacteristicClass.addCommGroup","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes.lean#L37-L37","doc":"The obstruction space is an additive abelian group. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumCharacteristicClass.ObstructionSpace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumCharacteristicClass.ObstructionSpace","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes.lean#L35-L35","doc":"The obstruction space (representing H²(𝒮, ℬ)). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumCharacteristicClass.level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumCharacteristicClass.level","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes.lean#L33-L33","doc":"Level in the brane tower. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumCharacteristicClass.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumCharacteristicClass.mk","kind":"ctor","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes.lean#L31-L31","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumCharacteristicClass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumCharacteristicClass","kind":"structure","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes.lean#L23-L39","doc":"A quantum characteristic class at level n: the obstruction to\nextending the gerbe from level n to level n+1.\n\nWhen κₙ = 0, the extension is unobstructed and the brane tower\ncontinues; non-vanishing κₙ indicates topological charge.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:quantum-characteristic-classes}` ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:quantum-characteristic-classes","label":"def:quantum-characteristic-classes","md":"quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}